vtime
args /killseed
# killseed
# m38: the ending (ending.pas endgame, "main /killseed"): end1-end4 with their story text after
# halffading, the end5-over-end6 scroll and its text, the credits (writestr2, dothefade) and
# intro2 until a key; exit code 3. (The script waits while a key is unread: the credits run
# between Z5 and Z6 - the original reads that key only on intro2; the intro2 dump checks the palette.)
# vbls 120000
wait 9000
shot Z1
key #32
wait 9000
shot Z2
key #32
wait 9000
shot Z3
key #32
wait 9000
shot Z4
key #32
wait 9000
shot Z5
key #32
wait 3000
shot Z6
key #32
wait 3000
quit
